  m_text: "<color=#5EC8E5>\uE3E7</color>  Choose an orbit, a launcher and the science instruments.\n<color=#5EC8E5>\uE530</color>  Stay within the mass, power, budget and slot limits.\n<color=#5EC8E5>\uE226</color>  The STATUS light tells you whether you can launch and whether any evidence is missing.\n<color=#5EC8E5>\uE448</color>  After launch, follow the spacecraft's transmissions and get a report that explains the outcome."
